{"language_code":"spa","language_probability":1.0,"text":"Y la quinta carta, el consejo para ti: La Sacerdotisa. Una mujer serena entre dos columnas, con un libro medio escondido entre sus ropas. Este es el mensaje más importante de tu montón: confía en lo que sientes. Tú ya sabes más de lo que crees sobre esta persona. No necesitas que nadie te lo confirme, ni siquiera las cartas. La Sacerdotisa te pide silencio, observación y paciencia. No persigas, no presiones. Mira, escucha y deja que las cosas se muestren solas","words":[{"text":"Y","start":0.08,"end":0.14,"type":"word","logprob":-0.000947503256611526},{"text":" ","start":0.14,"end":0.18,"type":"spacing","logprob":-3.933898824470816e-6},{"text":"la","start":0.18,"end":0.24,"type":"word","logprob":-3.933898824470816e-6},{"text":" ","start":0.24,"end":0.32,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.00017736769223120064},{"text":"quinta","start":0.32,"end":0.56,"type":"word","logprob":-0.00017736769223120064},{"text":" ","start":0.56,"end":0.64,"type":"spacing","logprob":-4.172316494077677e-6},{"text":"carta,","start":0.64,"end":0.94,"type":"word","logprob":-0.000016966902649073745},{"text":" ","start":0.94,"end":1.28,"type":"spacing","logprob":-9.894321920000948e-6},{"text":"el","start":1.28,"end":1.34,"type":"word","logprob":-9.894321920000948e-6},{"text":" ","start":1.34,"end":1.42,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.000023364747903542593},{"text":"consejo","start":1.42,"end":1.78,"type":"word","logprob":-0.000023364747903542593},{"text":" ","start":1.78,"end":1.86,"type":"spacing","logprob":-5.960462772236497e-7},{"text":"para","start":1.86,"end":2.02,"type":"word","logprob":-5.960462772236497e-7},{"text":" ","start":2.02,"end":2.1,"type":"spacing","logprob":-1.9073468138230965e-6},{"text":"ti:","start":2.1,"end":2.26,"type":"word","logprob":-0.0001987031416016786},{"text":" ","start":2.26,"end":2.9,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.6326236128807068},{"text":"La","start":2.9,"end":2.98,"type":"word","logprob":-0.6326236128807068},{